' CareFlow system diagrams — vanilla PlantUML (no C4 includes, no HTML colors).
' Render locally if you have PlantUML; this repo does not commit SVG/PNG or a CI job.
' Diagrams: context | containers | components | sequence_j1 | deploy
' Solid = running now; dashed = planned (including KMHFR live sync).

@startuml context
title CareFlow context

actor "Care-seeker\n(/patient)" as CS
actor "Hospital desk /\nclinician (/hospital)" as HD
actor "SMS + voice call\n(+254)" as Phone

rectangle "CareFlow\nKenya pretriage PWA + FastAPI + Postgres" as CF

cloud "Firebase Auth" as FB
cloud "KMHFR\n(facility SoT)" as KM
cloud "Africa's Talking" as AT
cloud "ElevenLabs" as EL
cloud "Twilio" as TW
cloud "Pawa AI" as PA

CS --> CF
HD --> CF
CF --> Phone : confirm / reminder /\nno-show (P5)
CF --> FB : verify ID tokens
CF ..> KM : live sync planned\n(Nairobi seed today)
CF --> AT
CF --> EL
CF --> TW
CF --> PA

note bottom of KM
  Esri ArcGIS layer is QA / bootstrap only.
  Not source of truth. Not SHA / AfyaKE.
end note
@enduml

@startuml containers
title CareFlow containers

rectangle "Client (one origin)" {
  component "Next.js 15 PWA\n/  /patient  /hospital" as PWA
}

rectangle "API" {
  component "FastAPI\nranking + vendor keys\nno /v1 prefix" as API
}

database "PostgreSQL 16\n+ pgvector\n+ cube/earthdistance\n(D-001 only product store)" as PG

cloud "Firebase Auth\n(auth only, not product store)" as FB

PWA --> API : NEXT_PUBLIC_API_URL\nCORS FRONTEND_ORIGIN
API --> PG : app role careflow\nAlembic careflow_owner
API --> FB : Admin SDK ID-token verify
PWA ..> FB : client SDK planned (P3)

note bottom of API
  Secrets stay on FastAPI (Phantom local / Render env).
  PWA never holds vendor or Admin keys.
end note
@enduml

@startuml components
title FastAPI packages — live vs planned

skinparam package<<planned>> {
  BorderStyle dashed
}
skinparam component<<planned>> {
  BorderStyle dashed
}

package "Next.js PWA (shells live)" {
  [role picker /]
  [/patient]
  [/hospital]
}

package "FastAPI live" {
  [core] as core
  [auth] as auth
  [facilities] as fac
}

package "FastAPI planned" <<planned>> {
  [symptoms] as sym <<planned>>
  [triage] as tri <<planned>>
  [bookings] as book <<planned>>
  [hospital] as hosp <<planned>>
  [notes] as notes <<planned>>
  [notify] as ntf <<planned>>
  [voice] as voice <<planned>>
}

database "Postgres\nAlembic 0001 DDL" as PG
cloud "Firebase" as FB
cloud "KMHFR" as KM
cloud "AT / EL / Twilio / Pawa" as V

[/patient] --> auth
[/patient] --> fac
[/patient] ..> sym
[/patient] ..> book
[/patient] ..> voice
[/hospital] ..> hosp
[/hospital] ..> notes
[role picker /] ..> voice : J8 consent (P3)

core --> PG
auth --> FB
auth --> PG
fac --> PG
fac ..> KM : sync planned
sym ..> PG
tri ..> PG
book ..> PG
hosp ..> PG
notes ..> PG
ntf ..> PG
ntf ..> V
voice ..> V

note right of fac
  GET /facilities/recommend
  wait then distance, Kenya bbox,
  Nairobi seed. Red-flag path planned.
end note
@enduml

@startuml sequence_j1
title J1 care-seeker routine (target)\nSolid = API/PWA running now; dashed = planned

actor "Care-seeker" as CS
participant "Next.js PWA" as PWA
participant "FastAPI" as API
database "Postgres" as PG
participant "Firebase" as FB
participant "Notify\n(AT / EL / Twilio / Pawa)" as NV

CS -> PWA : open / (role picker)
note right of PWA : live shell; J8 voice consent planned
CS --> PWA : J8 activate voice?
CS --> PWA : Firebase sign-in
PWA --> API : GET /me
API -> FB : verify Bearer ID token
API -> PG : users.role / facility_id
CS --> PWA : symptoms (form or STT)
PWA --> API : POST /symptoms/map
API --> PG : catalog + pgvector synonyms
note right of API : rules pick KEPH (INV-05);\nembeddings never pick the hospital
PWA -> API : GET /facilities/recommend
API -> PG : keph_level >= keph_min\nORDER wait_count, distance
API -> PWA : facilities[]
note right of API : recommend is live\n(Nairobi seed; no red-flag rank yet)
CS --> PWA : book one facility
PWA --> API : POST /bookings
API --> PG : booking booked; wait_count++
API --> NV : SMS confirm (or DEMO_NOTIFY log)
NV --> CS : SMS
note over NV : fail closed to text + SMS (INV-13);\nnever block booking
CS -> PWA : goes to facility
PWA --> API : staff POST .../arrived
API --> PG : status arrived; wait_count--
@enduml

@startuml deploy
title Deploy — local Compose vs Render staging

node "Developer machine" {
  component "next dev :3000\n(host, not Compose)" as NextHost
  node "docker compose" {
    component "api :8000" as ApiLocal
    database "db\npgvector/pgvector:pg16" as DbLocal
  }
}

NextHost --> ApiLocal : FRONTEND_ORIGIN\nhttp://localhost:3000
ApiLocal --> DbLocal : DATABASE_URL (careflow)\nDATABASE_ADMIN_URL (owner)

cloud "Render staging (Blueprint applied, not production)" {
  component "careflow-web\nNode PWA\ncareflow-web.onrender.com" as WebR
  component "careflow-api\nDocker\ncareflow-api-y00r.onrender.com" as ApiR
  database "careflow-db\nPostgres 16 Oregon" as DbR
  component "CareFlow static (leftover)\ncareflow-sei7.onrender.com" as StaticOld
}

WebR --> ApiR : NEXT_PUBLIC_API_URL\nfrom careflow-api RENDER_EXTERNAL_URL\n(build-time; rebuild if first deploy raced)
ApiR --> WebR : FRONTEND_ORIGIN\nfrom careflow-web RENDER_EXTERNAL_URL
ApiR --> DbR : DATABASE_URL + DATABASE_ADMIN_URL\nboth from careflow-db connectionString\n(staging shortcut)

note bottom of StaticOld
  Not in Blueprint exs-da91jphsrm7s73atarb0.
  Humans suspend after careflow-web is live.
  Agents must not delete it.
end note

note bottom of WebR
  Not production. Do not claim NFR-AVAIL-01.
  Blueprint exs-da91jphsrm7s73atarb0 (dev).
  GET /health on careflow-api is live.
  DEMO_NOTIFY=1 never live-dials.
  Dual-URL staging shortcut: same DB owner string
  for DATABASE_URL and DATABASE_ADMIN_URL;
  dual careflow / careflow_owner + RLS is out of scope.
  Phantom locally; dashboard sync:false for FIREBASE_*.
  MCP cannot create Docker web services;
  further API changes: git push to dev or trigger_deploy.
end note
@enduml
